# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# TAPPs repository — ALLOWLIST .gitignore
#
# Everything in the project root is ignored by default. Only the paths
# un-ignored below are tracked. The per-technique working folders (EPMA/,
# SEM/, TEM/, LA-*/, Solution */, XCT/, etc.) stay local: they hold the
# publisher PDF libraries and scratch material that must not go to GitHub.
#
# To START TRACKING a new root-level folder, add a line:   !/Folder Name/
# The trailing slash matters. Nothing inside a tracked folder needs its own
# rule — git descends into it automatically.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# 1. Ignore every root-level entry ('/*' matches only the top level).
/*

# 2. Re-include the tracked folders.
!/Archive/
!/Claude Skills for TAPP/
!/Current TAPPs/
!/Project Files/
!/Superseded TAPPs/

# 3. Re-include the tracked root-level files.
!/.gitattributes
!/.gitignore
!/composed_tapps.json
!/README_TAPP_for_Schema_Generation.md

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 4. Junk, excluded everywhere including inside tracked folders.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# macOS Finder metadata
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
._*

# Excel / Word lock files written while a document is open
~$*
.~lock.*

# Ad-hoc backup copies (*.bak, *.bak_v5, *.bak_phase4, *.bak7, ...)
*.bak
*.bak_*
*.bak[0-9]*

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.venv/
venv/

# Editor scratch
*.swp
*~
